  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding Sustainability Commitments Through Christian Business Stakeholders In South and East Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed at targeting Christian business stakeholders in South and East Asia to increase their commitment to promoting sustainability and tackling climate change.

Through a series of forums and conferences, this project will work with Christian business stakeholders to raise awareness on the impacts of climate change on communities in South and East Asia. Through developing a strong network of business stakeholders and promoting a deeper understanding of climate change impacts, this project hopes to encourage a greater sense of responsibility amongst Christian business stakeholders to contribute &apos;green funds&apos; to support adaptation and mitigation initiatives in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
